  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我是密阿雷守护协会的代表，守户。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A6211662F5BC6963F96F75B8862A4534F4F1A76844EE38868FF0C5B886237300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "之前我去围堵阔星总裁的做法\n太小孩子气了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E4B524D621153BB56F458359614661F603B88C17684505A6CD5000A592A5C0F5B695B506C144E86300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我要在这里向你道歉！\n当时的事情真的非常抱歉。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE56211898157288FD991CC54114F6090536B49FF01000A5F5365F676844E8B60C5771F7684975E5E3862B16B49300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "再怎么说我都是密阿雷守护协会的代表，\n所以我会像现在这样遵守礼仪的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "518D600E4E488BF4621190FD662F5BC6963F96F75B8862A4534F4F1A76844EE38868FF0C000A62404EE562114F1A50CF73B057288FD9683790755B88793C4EEA7684300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "然后说到密阿雷守护协会的正义，\n那就是保护密阿雷的市民免受不安的侵扰！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7136540E8BF452305BC6963F96F75B8862A4534F4F1A76846B634E49FF0C000A90A35C31662F4FDD62A45BC6963F96F776845E026C11514D53D74E0D5B8976844FB56270FF0100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最近有个颇具人气的视频号\n名叫灵异迷频道，号如其名，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n是一个做灵异内容的账号。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67008FD167094E2A988751774EBA6C14768489C6989153F7000A540D53EB70755F028FF798919053FF0C53F759825176540DFF0C00100001BE00000A662F4E004E2A505A70755F0251855BB976848D2653F7300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但也有密阿雷市民因为看了\n这个频道的内容而感到不安！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F464E5F67095BC6963F96F75E026C1156E04E3A770B4E86000A8FD94E2A98919053768451855BB9800C611F52304E0D5B89FF0100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "北侧大道的大楼里有\n女幽灵之类的，很恐怖对吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53174FA75927905376845927697C91CC6709000A59735E7D70754E4B7C7B7684FF0C5F88605060165BF95427FF0100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是有人散布这种毫无根据的谣言，\n我必须要向运营方投诉！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F67094EBA65635E038FD979CD6BEB65E06839636E76848C238A00FF0C000A62115FC5987B898154118FD0842565B962958BC9FF0100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因此我想请<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>你\n帮我确认灵异迷频道投稿的内容<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n到底是不是真的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E06B64621160F38BF700100002010000004F60000A5E2E6211786E8BA470755F028FF79891905362957A3F768451855BB900100001BE00000A52305E95662F4E0D662F771F7684FF0100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请看！\n这条投稿里的这段发言。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF7770BFF01000A8FD9676162957A3F91CC76848FD96BB553D18A00300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "闪耀巨影之梢与\n红白圆形之绘画交叠时。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n以拳叩地者身后\n应有幼子亡灵悄然而至。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n……信与不信由您自身定夺。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "95EA80005DE85F714E4B68A24E0E000A7EA2767D57065F624E4B7ED8753B4EA453E065F6300200100001BE01000A4EE562F353E9573080058EAB540E000A5E9467095E7C5B504EA1707560847136800C81F3300200100001BE01000A202620264FE14E0E4E0D4FE1753160A881EA8EAB5B9A593A300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "究竟是想通过胡说八道来博眼球，\n还是在诉说真相……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n有<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>你在，一定能查清。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7A767ADF662F60F3901A8FC780E18BF4516B90536765535A773C7403FF0C000A8FD8662F57288BC98BF4771F76F82026202600100001BE00000A670900100002010000004F605728FF0C4E005B9A80FD67E56E05300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想要你调查的是\n下面这条信息到底是不是真的。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n闪耀巨影之梢与\n红白圆形之绘画交叠时。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n以拳叩地者身后\n应有幼子亡灵悄然而至。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F389814F608C0367E57684662F000A4E0B97628FD967614FE1606F52305E95662F4E0D662F771F7684300200100001BE01000A95EA80005DE85F714E4B68A24E0E000A7EA2767D57065F624E4B7ED8753B4EA453E065F6300200100001BE01000A4EE562F353E9573080058EAB540E000A5E9467095E7C5B504EA1707560847136800C81F3300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "都市传说里所说的地点\n应该就是这里才对啊……？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90FD5E024F208BF491CC62408BF47684573070B9000A5E948BE55C31662F8FD991CC624D5BF9554A20262026FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有塔的影子落在\n都市传说里所说的地点上面。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6709585476845F715B50843D5728000A90FD5E024F208BF491CC62408BF47684573070B94E0A976230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要朝着地面锤下拳头吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981671D77405730976295244E0B62F359345417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锤下拳头！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "95244E0B62F35934FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就让我们来一起确认一下\n视频的投稿内容到底是不是真的吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C318BA962114EEC67654E008D77786E8BA44E004E0B000A89C69891768462957A3F51855BB952305E95662F4E0D662F771F76845427300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "小孩子的亡灵！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0F5B695B5076844EA17075FF01FF1F00100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了确认投稿的内容到底是不是真的，\n我们必须要捕获它！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E86786E8BA462957A3F768451855BB952305E95662F4E0D662F771F7684FF0C000A62114EEC5FC5987B8981635583B75B83FF0100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等一下等一下！\n你得捉住它呀！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E004E0B7B494E004E0BFF01000A4F605F9763494F4F5B835440FF0100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原来如此，原来如此。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F676559826B64FF0C539F676559826B64300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "灵异迷频道的投稿\n说的原来是这么一回事啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70755F028FF798919053768462957A3F000A8BF47684539F6765662F8FD94E484E0056DE4E8B554A300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是说，这是一个\n发布真实内容的视频账号。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8BF4FF0C8FD9662F4E004E2A000A53D15E03771F5B9E51855BB9768489C698918D2653F7300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "既然如此，那我就去\n和运营方报告一声，告诉他们<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n这不是个散布谣言的频道。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E2713659826B64FF0C90A362115C3153BB000A548C8FD0842565B962A5544A4E0058F0FF0C544A8BC94ED64EEC00100001BE00000A8FD94E0D662F4E2A65635E038C238A00768498919053300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辛苦你了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F9B82E64F604E86300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果是这样的话……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C662F8FD9683776848BDD2026202600100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "北侧大道的大楼里有\n女幽灵是真的！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53174FA75927905376845927697C91CC6709000A59735E7D7075662F771F7684FF01FF1F00100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你从塔的危机中拯救了密阿雷，\n可以成为密阿雷守护协会的会员！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604ECE585476845371673A4E2D62EF65514E865BC6963F96F7FF0C000A53EF4EE562104E3A5BC6963F96F75B8862A4534F4F1A76844F1A5458FF0100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    }
